{
  "_": "THE canonical-key truth table. One file, two copies, byte-identical: sketchcast-app/src/utils/__tests__/fixtures/catalogue_key_cases.json and sketchcast/tests/fixtures/catalogue_key_cases.json. Both tests pin the sha256 below of the LF-normalised bytes.",
  "rules": [
    "1. Unicode NFKD, remove combining marks (Unicode category M), lower-case.",
    "2. Replace '&' with ' and '.",
    "3. Every run of characters not in [a-z0-9] becomes one '_'.",
    "4. Trim leading and trailing '_'.",
    "5. Drop ONE leading article token: 'the', 'a' or 'an' (a title that is only an article becomes '').",
    "6. For each '_'-separated token: drop a final 's' when the token is purely alphabetic [a-z], has at least 4 letters, and the letter before that 's' is not 's' and not one of a/i/o/u (so a consonant or an 'e'). Tokens with digits (curriculum codes), a lone 's', 'glass' (ss), 'gas'/'bus'/'this' (vowel) and 3-letter words stay.",
    "7. Rejoin with '_'."
  ],
